Wait for gitlab-webservice-default-* to roll to a new pod and become Running 2/2: and run kubectl get pods -n gitlab

helm upgrade gitlab gitlab/gitlab \
  -n gitlab \
  --version 9.10.5 \
  -f bonus/gitlab/values.yaml \
  --timeout 600s
in another ssh 

to get the password :kubectl get secret gitlab-gitlab-initial-root-password -n gitlab \
  -o jsonpath='{.data.password}' | base64 -d; echo
for login is root


run vagrant ssh -- -L 8181:localhost:8181
this to run main cmd : kubectl port-forward -n gitlab svc/gitlab-webservice-default 8181:8181






